                        <div class="col-sm-7 px-5">
                            <div id="footprintThreeIntro">
                                <div id="landingTitleTwo">
                                    <h2 class="sub-hdr my-3">To The Olympics and Para Games</h2>
                                </div>
                                <p>Supporting women in sport is a cause close to Aparajita’s heart. The 2020 Tokyo Olympics saw Sutirtha Mukherjee &#8211; sponsored by Aparajita &#8211; represent India in table tennis.</p>
                                <p><button class="theme-btn theme-btn-light" id="footprintThreeReadMoreBtn" onclick="myFunction2()">Read More</button></p>
                            </div>
                            <div id="fullFootprintThree" style="display:none">
                                <h2 class="sub-hdr my-3">To The Olympics &amp; Para Games</h2>
                                <p>Supporting women in sport is a cause close to Aparajita’s heart. The 2020 Tokyo Olympics saw Sutirtha Mukherjee &#8211; sponsored by Aparajita &#8211; represent India in table tennis. By offering financial assistance, training, and exposure, Aparajita has enabled Sutirtha and other sportswomen like her to pursue their aspirations, including the incredible athlete Rakshitha Raju who represented India at the Para Athletics World Championships in 2023.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-12 content-gap">
                    <div class="row d-flex align-items-center">
                        <div class="col-sm-7 px-5 odr-mob">
                            <div id="footprintOneIntro">
                                <h2 class="sub-hdr my-3">Illuminating Futures With New Light</h2>
                                <p>Aparajita, with New Light Foundation served sex workers and their families in 2021.</p>
                                <p><button class="theme-btn theme-btn-light" id="footprintOneReadMoreBtn" onclick="myFunction3()">Read More</button></p>
                            </div>
                            <div id="fullFootprintOne" style="display:none">
                                <h2 class="sub-hdr my-3">Illuminating Futures With New Light</h2>
                                <p>Aparajita, with New Light Foundation served sex workers and their families in 2021. New Light Foundation provides vital resources and opportunities to the communities and families at risk, operating from a red light district in Kolkata. Aparajita touched the lives of its beneficiaries to receive training sessions and join her on-ground hospitality team at the main ceremony in 2021. With Ushosee Sengupta and the support of the Marriott HR and Hospitality teams, she conducted a number of training sessions at JW Marriott leading up to the main event. She hoped to offer these young girls a brighter future.</p>
