                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-7 px-5">
                            <div id="footprintFourIntro">
                                <div id="landingTitleThree">
                                    <h2 class="sub-hdr my-3">Support For Menstrual Hygiene</h2>
                                </div>
                                <p>On World Menstrual Hygiene Day, Aparajita organised a large-scale distribution of 11,000 sanitary napkins to raise awareness and support menstrual hygiene among women.</p>
                                <p><button class="theme-btn theme-btn-light" id="footprintFourReadMoreBtn" onclick="myFunction4()">Read More</button></p>
                            </div>
                            <div id="fullFootprintFour" style="display:none">
                                <h2 class="sub-hdr my-3">Support For Menstrual Hygiene</h2>
                                <p>On World Menstrual Hygiene Day, Aparajita organised a large-scale distribution of 11,000 sanitary napkins to raise awareness and support menstrual hygiene among women. Her efforts were spread across 4 less-privileged areas that receive great footfall in Kolkata, West Bengal. She has also partnered with Niine to distribute sanitary napkins and set up vending machines at 25 sites in Kolkata.</p>
